CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/as com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/UnitData
	COMMENT Percolated UnitData overrides for a custom unit: static field tables s (all UnitDataFields by name) and t (network-synced fields), with clone(), diff-apply (a(unit,data,fields)), and compact net (de)serialization that writes only changed fields as (id,value,default) triples. Field names are the ini keys: mass, maxenergy, energy, maxhp, hp, maxshield, shield, shieldregen, armour, maxattackrange, shootdelaymultiplier, shootdamagemultiplier, movespeed, maxturnspeed, fogofwarsightrange, nanorange, selfregenrate, targetHeight, nanoFactorySpeed. [evidence-based job name]
